This product includes data from the NASA Open Science Data Repository
(OSD-569, SpaceX Inspiration4 complete blood count), available at
https://osdr.nasa.gov/bio/repo/data/studies/OSD-569

The 3D body (frontend/public/models/anatomy.glb) is adapted from BodyParts3D:
"BodyParts3D, © The Database Center for Life Science licensed under CC Attribution
4.0 International" (https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/lic.html).
Changes: parts merged into skin, skeleton, brain, heart and airways; meshes
simplified; moved to the panel's frame; the front of the pelvis flattened; body
zones and pointer spots added. The OBJ headers of the source files still quote the
database's earlier licence (CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan); the database's licence page now
states CC BY 4.0. Built by scripts/build_anatomy.py.
